# ConnectAPA – Copilot Instructions
These instructions guide GitHub Copilot when generating code for the ConnectAPA library.  
ConnectAPA is responsible ONLY for communicating with the APA GraphQL API at:

**https://gql.poolplayers.com/graphql**

Do NOT generate SQL, EF Core, or CueConnect logic in this project.

---

## 📌 Core Requirements
- Use **HttpClient** to send GraphQL requests to:  
  `https://gql.poolplayers.com/graphql`
- APA requires **batched GraphQL requests**, even for single operations.
- All requests must include the Authorization header:  
  `Authorization: Bearer {token}`
- Queries must be stored in `.graphql` files under `GraphQL/Queries/`.
- Do NOT attempt schema introspection (APA blocks it).
- Use **raw GraphQL strings** loaded from the `.graphql` files.
- Use **System.Text.Json** for serialization instead of Newtonsoft/GraphQL.Client abstractions.

